WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:42.955
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:43.225 --> 01:44.585
He flaked on us.

3
01:44.665 --> 01:46.185
Why do you look kind of happy?

4
01:47.665 --> 01:48.865
Do I?

5
01:50.225 --> 01:52.305
I just think

6
01:52.385 --> 01:54.185
the weather is great today.

7
02:02.945 --> 02:04.705
Are we setting out yet?

8
02:06.705 --> 02:08.025
Are you sitting there?

9
02:08.825 --> 02:10.024
What's wrong?

10
02:12.025 --> 02:13.865
My driving is just so-so.

11
02:13.945 --> 02:16.505
If I miss an exit or go the wrong way,

12
02:16.585 --> 02:17.425
we'll waste time.

13
02:20.025 --> 02:21.385
Bi Dezheng isn't coming.

14
02:21.465 --> 02:24.145
There's no one next to me to warn me.

15
02:25.025 --> 02:26.425
Then I'll sit up front.

16
02:35.265 --> 02:36.505
I brought them for you.

17
02:37.385 --> 02:38.425
Thank you.

18
02:47.825 --> 02:48.865
Let's go.

19
03:01.785 --> 03:04.465
FAST REPAIRS OF PHONES AND DIGITAL DEVICES

20
03:05.185 --> 03:07.265
It's the weekend. What's with the backpack?

21
03:08.265 --> 03:09.425
I'm going to study.

22
03:10.025 --> 03:13.225
Well, you can study anywhere. Why do you need to go out?

23
03:14.785 --> 03:16.145
It's with a classmate.

24
03:16.745 --> 03:17.745
Which classmate?

25
03:17.825 --> 03:19.065
Give me your phone.

26
03:19.145 --> 03:20.185
Call him.

27
03:22.825 --> 03:25.385
It has only been a few days of calm.

28
03:25.465 --> 03:27.265
I thought you had finally given up.

29
03:27.345 --> 03:29.065
What could happen at a hospital?

30
03:29.145 --> 03:31.305
Did they have to call a high school student?

31
03:31.385 --> 03:33.625
-I'm not going to the hospital. -Denying it?

32
03:33.705 --> 03:35.985
Listen, you're not going anywhere today.

33
03:44.665 --> 03:47.825
Something came up today. I can't tutor you. Can we reschedule?

34
03:47.905 --> 03:49.785
JIANG MIAN

35
03:49.865 --> 03:52.185
This is way too last-minute.

36
03:52.265 --> 03:54.385
We can't reschedule. I already came out.

37
03:54.465 --> 03:56.465
You promised to fill in for Ms. Zheng.

38
03:56.545 --> 03:58.665
I'm telling your sister!

39
04:02.025 --> 04:04.625
What's this? Are you really standing me up?

40
04:06.225 --> 04:09.305
Sorry, the subscriber you dialed is not available.

41
04:15.785 --> 04:16.705
Hello, Jiahuan.

42
04:17.305 --> 04:19.465
Do you know people in Year 2, Class 8?

43
04:20.425 --> 04:23.185
Help me ask around and find out where Jian Mian lives.

44
04:23.265 --> 04:25.625
JIANG HAIXING DIGITAL REPAIR

45
04:30.065 --> 04:31.625
Can people live here?

46
04:32.625 --> 04:33.745
FAST REPAIRS

47
04:36.065 --> 04:37.865
What do you want to buy?

48
04:37.945 --> 04:40.025
Hello, sir. Are you Jiang Mian's dad?

49
04:41.745 --> 04:42.745
I am.

50
04:44.065 --> 04:45.945
I am Jiang Mian's…

51
04:46.545 --> 04:47.985
classmate.

52
04:48.065 --> 04:50.105
He and I have tutoring with a teacher.

53
04:50.825 --> 04:52.625
He couldn't be reached on the phone,

54
04:52.705 --> 04:55.585
so the teacher asked me to come and see

55
04:55.665 --> 04:58.465
if something came up that he needs help with.

56
04:58.545 --> 05:00.145
Teacher?

57
05:00.985 --> 05:03.425
He didn't tell me. What tutoring?

58
05:04.985 --> 05:06.465
It's a private lesson for us.

59
05:06.545 --> 05:08.625
We're not supposed to tell anyone.

60
05:08.705 --> 05:11.585
She's afraid other students would have complaints.

61
05:11.665 --> 05:14.305
After all, it's free private tutoring.

62
05:14.385 --> 05:15.425
Sir, you understand.

63
05:19.465 --> 05:20.305
I guess

64
05:20.385 --> 05:22.185
Jiang Mian

65
05:22.265 --> 05:23.785
isn't free today.

66
05:23.865 --> 05:25.105
It's okay.

67
05:25.185 --> 05:26.985
I'll just go back and tell Ms. Sun

68
05:27.065 --> 05:29.305
so she doesn't blame Jiang Mian.

69
05:30.985 --> 05:32.665
Wait, you…

70
05:33.785 --> 05:35.785
Can he still make it if he goes now?

71
05:36.585 --> 05:38.345
Yes. Where is he?

72
05:38.425 --> 05:40.025
I… Hold on.

73
05:40.105 --> 05:41.345
Jiang Mian!

74
05:41.425 --> 05:43.065
Jiang Mian, I was wrong!

75
05:43.145 --> 05:44.745
I wrongly blamed you!

76
05:44.825 --> 05:47.345
Listen, it's all thanks to my cleverness and wit.

77
05:47.945 --> 05:51.025
You lied. There is no private lesson from a teacher.

78
05:51.105 --> 05:53.625
If lying is wrong, why did you play along?

79
05:53.705 --> 05:55.785
Would we be here if you hadn't played along?

80
05:56.465 --> 05:57.865
But your dad…

81
05:57.945 --> 06:00.025
That guy keeps you on such a tight leash.

82
06:00.105 --> 06:01.385
He looks so mean.

83
06:01.465 --> 06:05.425
He looks completely different from when he gave you those gloves.

84
06:06.465 --> 06:08.425
That's why I threw away those gloves.

85
06:08.505 --> 06:09.665
You did?

86
06:10.305 --> 06:12.945
So you didn't accidentally toss them.

87
06:13.025 --> 06:13.945
It was on purpose.

88
06:17.185 --> 06:18.505
He's just my uncle.

89
06:19.545 --> 06:21.585
No, not even that.

90
06:22.185 --> 06:23.385
He divorced long ago.

91
06:23.465 --> 06:25.585
He has no wife or kids.

92
06:26.185 --> 06:28.825
He adopted me to have someone take care of him later.

93
06:29.625 --> 06:30.905
He's so controlling

94
06:30.985 --> 06:33.345
because he's afraid I'll leave with my sister.

95
06:37.865 --> 06:40.385
Was it a hassle to come here?

96
06:42.425 --> 06:44.585
Why would it be? It was so much fun.

97
06:45.705 --> 06:48.425
My mom told me a story when I was young.

98
06:48.505 --> 06:51.305
In fairy tales,

99
06:51.385 --> 06:53.425
a clever and valiant princess

100
06:53.505 --> 06:55.905
must complete a series of impossible tasks

101
06:55.985 --> 06:58.385
to rescue a prince imprisoned by a dragon.

102
06:58.465 --> 07:01.305
No matter how difficult it is,

103
07:01.385 --> 07:04.105
she will join hands with the prince to attain victory.

104
07:07.225 --> 07:10.265
Turns out there really is an imprisoned prince.

105
07:12.385 --> 07:15.505
The next time you're trapped, call this princess to rescue you.

106
07:19.105 --> 07:21.745
To celebrate our successful rescue today!

107
07:33.465 --> 07:35.385
You've been carrying this.

108
07:35.465 --> 07:36.865
What is it?

109
07:40.625 --> 07:42.745
I got up early to line up for it.

110
07:42.825 --> 07:44.505
It's the best sushi in Qingyi.

111
07:45.305 --> 07:47.825
Who knew I would nearly get stood up?

112
07:47.905 --> 07:49.105
Don't you want tutoring?

113
07:50.225 --> 07:51.225
Yes.

114
07:51.305 --> 07:55.185
Eating the best sushi doesn't get in the way of getting the best lesson.

115
07:58.305 --> 08:00.625
It also serves as a bribe

116
08:00.705 --> 08:02.425
for my new teacher.

117
08:02.505 --> 08:05.345
Have mercy during my lesson.

118
08:08.105 --> 08:09.505
What a shame.

119
08:09.585 --> 08:11.225
It originally came with wasabi.

120
08:11.305 --> 08:14.505
Now the taste will be just shy of perfect.

121
08:15.745 --> 08:17.065
Where did the wasabi go?

122
08:18.825 --> 08:20.065
Just eat it.

123
08:20.145 --> 08:21.865
Don't ask so many questions.

124
08:26.865 --> 08:28.625
REPAIRS AND RECYCLING

125
08:32.185 --> 08:33.784
Jiang Mian!

126
08:33.865 --> 08:35.425
I don't let you go out,

127
08:35.505 --> 08:37.144
and you refuse to talk to me?

128
08:37.225 --> 08:39.985
Who is the one who feeds you?

129
08:40.065 --> 08:41.585
Since you entered high school,

130
08:41.664 --> 08:45.745
that money sink hasn't spent any money on you, you know that?!

131
08:45.825 --> 08:47.945
If not for me, would you get an education?

132
08:48.025 --> 08:49.985
You would be stuck in your hometown!

133
08:51.625 --> 08:53.545
Why is this person so mean?

134
09:02.185 --> 09:03.545
WASABI ON TOP

135
09:19.665 --> 09:21.305
What do you want to buy?

136
09:21.385 --> 09:24.265
Hello, sir. Are you Jiang Mian's dad?

137
09:26.505 --> 09:29.185
Jiang Mian is quite popular with the girls.

138
09:29.945 --> 09:31.425
He takes after me.

139
10:13.145 --> 10:16.785
It's best to take samples at fixed times. Let's do it in two hours.

140
10:16.865 --> 10:18.865
Did we come too early?

141
10:19.505 --> 10:20.945
Why Qingshan Island?

142
10:21.545 --> 10:24.345
I heard long ago that it's very beautiful,

143
10:24.425 --> 10:25.585
so I wanted to see it.

144
10:27.385 --> 10:28.225
We're not early.

145
10:28.305 --> 10:30.705
We get time to look around.

146
10:32.425 --> 10:36.665
This path leads to Qingshan Tower. We can see the whole island from the top.

147
10:38.065 --> 10:39.785
You've done your research.

148
10:41.345 --> 10:43.225
Just in case someone asked,

149
10:43.305 --> 10:45.225
I didn't want to be clueless.

150
10:45.305 --> 10:46.385
Let's go.

151
10:47.545 --> 10:49.465
We just follow this path.

152
10:57.705 --> 10:58.545
Not bad, right?

153
10:59.705 --> 11:01.225
The view is nice.

154
11:02.305 --> 11:05.265
We can also see both lighthouses from here.

155
11:05.345 --> 11:06.665
By the way,

156
11:06.745 --> 11:08.785
there's a legend about the lighthouses.

157
11:09.785 --> 11:12.105
When two people climb up here together,

158
11:12.185 --> 11:16.985
the direction of travel of the first ship they see between the lighthouses

159
11:17.065 --> 11:20.185
is where the two will travel to together in the future.

160
11:22.145 --> 11:26.225
Why does that sound like a story made up by the Tourism Bureau?

161
11:29.145 --> 11:30.705
Believe what you want.

162
11:38.985 --> 11:40.385
West.

163
11:41.985 --> 11:44.545
There are a lot of cities to the west.

164
11:46.945 --> 11:48.905
I thought someone didn't believe in this.

165
11:53.065 --> 11:53.905
Chen Yanzhou,

166
11:54.745 --> 11:58.705
will you go to another city or country in the future?

167
12:00.985 --> 12:02.305
Why do you suddenly ask?

168
12:03.785 --> 12:05.825
I heard Mr. Li mention that

169
12:05.905 --> 12:08.745
the Haeckel Institute research opportunity is a good fit for you.

170
12:09.705 --> 12:12.745
It's what you're truly interested in

171
12:12.825 --> 12:14.625
and your preferred research focus.

172
12:17.705 --> 12:18.665
I don't want to go.

173
12:20.985 --> 12:21.825
Why?

174
12:23.825 --> 12:25.265
Because

175
12:26.865 --> 12:28.465
the people close to me

176
12:29.105 --> 12:31.025
matter far more than anything else.

177
12:36.985 --> 12:38.665
I think you're right.

178
12:39.345 --> 12:41.945
The Tourism Bureau must have made up that legend.

179
12:43.145 --> 12:44.425
I'm not going anywhere.

180
12:45.585 --> 12:46.425
I'll be here.

181
13:05.145 --> 13:07.265
RESEARCH FARM

182
13:07.905 --> 13:08.865
Bi Dezheng?

183
13:10.145 --> 13:12.705
Surprise! I'm here!

184
13:18.145 --> 13:19.065
Originally,

185
13:19.145 --> 13:20.385
I couldn't come.

186
13:20.465 --> 13:21.385
But as you said,

187
13:21.465 --> 13:23.985
it's a pity if we can't come as a team.

188
13:24.065 --> 13:27.825
How could I leave you with regrets? We're a team!

189
13:28.665 --> 13:30.385
Luckily, I made up my mind.

190
13:30.465 --> 13:33.385
There is still a while until the fixed sampling time.

191
13:33.465 --> 13:34.305
We can play.

192
13:35.025 --> 13:37.825
Sir, we want to rent some bikes.

193
13:37.905 --> 13:39.345
There are only two left.

194
13:48.985 --> 13:50.825
-Zheng Yu, why don't you-- -Oh well.

195
13:50.905 --> 13:53.145
Zheng Yu, sit behind me. I'll bike.

196
13:56.585 --> 13:59.985
You don't need to look at him. I can carry you. Come on.

197
14:03.105 --> 14:04.105
Bi Dezheng.

198
14:05.425 --> 14:06.905
You look so sharp today.

199
14:06.985 --> 14:09.945
You will definitely charm all the ladies as you bike around.

200
14:12.985 --> 14:14.625
W… What?

201
14:14.705 --> 14:16.625
Why are you suddenly complimenting me?

202
14:17.265 --> 14:18.505
Really?

203
14:20.425 --> 14:22.225
But if someone is riding behind you,

204
14:22.305 --> 14:24.265
others might get the wrong idea.

205
14:26.385 --> 14:27.385
True.

206
14:28.025 --> 14:30.065
You'll be ruining my chances.

207
14:32.945 --> 14:37.305
Yanzhou, why don't you take one for the team and carry Zheng Yu?

208
14:38.465 --> 14:39.305
No offense.

209
14:44.705 --> 14:46.265
She's so skinny. She's light!

210
14:51.505 --> 14:52.425
I'll owe you one.

211
14:57.225 --> 14:58.345
All right.

212
15:04.545 --> 15:06.025
Do I really look cool?

213
15:06.105 --> 15:07.345
Go on.

214
15:22.825 --> 15:25.385
Where did you trick Bi Dezheng into going?

215
15:26.065 --> 15:27.185
I have no idea where he went.

216
15:27.265 --> 15:30.265
All I know is we're going downhill.

217
15:30.345 --> 15:31.625
Sit tight.

218
16:08.265 --> 16:10.065
Take it. Come on.

219
16:35.145 --> 16:36.385
Get closer.

220
16:36.465 --> 16:37.465
Closer.

221
17:13.224 --> 17:14.625
It pisses me off!

222
17:14.704 --> 17:16.385
Twelve yuan for a bottle of water!

223
17:16.464 --> 17:18.105
I flirted for ten minutes

224
17:18.184 --> 17:19.625
and didn't get any discount!

225
17:20.224 --> 17:21.224
Flirted?

226
17:23.385 --> 17:25.025
By calling them "Brother"?

227
17:27.464 --> 17:28.945
Do I call anyone "Brother"?

228
17:30.345 --> 17:31.625
Then how do you flirt?

229
17:35.025 --> 17:37.145
Sister,

230
17:37.225 --> 17:38.945
take six yuan off.

231
17:39.025 --> 17:40.545
Twelve yuan per water bottle

232
17:40.625 --> 17:44.185
is just too outrageous.

233
17:44.265 --> 17:48.185
Brother, I like you the most.

234
17:51.985 --> 17:52.825
Zheng Yu,

235
17:52.905 --> 17:54.945
I rarely see you smiling so happily.

236
17:55.025 --> 17:55.865
What a surprise.

237
17:57.265 --> 17:59.225
There's a lot you don't know about me.

238
18:01.465 --> 18:03.265
Then do you know how to flirt?

239
18:05.065 --> 18:06.065
Why not?

240
18:08.785 --> 18:11.305
Come on, try it on me.

241
18:11.385 --> 18:13.065
Let's see how good you are.

242
18:14.225 --> 18:16.185
I'll give you a simple challenge.

243
18:16.265 --> 18:17.585
Just say,

244
18:18.385 --> 18:19.425
"Is it okay?"

245
18:23.825 --> 18:25.625
Bi Dezheng, is it okay?

246
18:27.985 --> 18:29.225
That's it?

247
18:30.065 --> 18:31.305
You call that flirting?

248
18:32.345 --> 18:34.225
-Isn't it? -How can it count?

249
18:35.145 --> 18:36.745
Maybe the target isn't right.

250
18:37.745 --> 18:40.025
W… What do you mean by that?

251
18:40.105 --> 18:42.385
You can do it with others but not me?

252
18:42.465 --> 18:43.305
Of course.

253
18:44.025 --> 18:46.385
Stubborn, are you? You're in for it.

254
18:46.985 --> 18:49.425
Come on. Say it to Chen Yanzhou.

255
18:57.985 --> 18:58.985
It's okay.

256
18:59.065 --> 19:01.265
Whatever you do, I won't make fun of you.

257
19:04.545 --> 19:07.185
Chen Yanzhou, is it okay?

258
19:13.305 --> 19:14.505
Okay.

259
19:15.225 --> 19:16.225
Okay, what?

260
19:17.025 --> 19:17.865
What's okay?

261
19:18.465 --> 19:20.025
Isn't it exactly the same?

262
19:20.105 --> 19:21.865
Chen Yanzhou, how is that flirting?

263
19:22.905 --> 19:25.145
Why not? You don't know how to appreciate it.

264
19:26.425 --> 19:27.425
I…

265
19:31.865 --> 19:35.145
Chen Yanzhou, you're smiling as if you're her boyfriend.

266
19:35.225 --> 19:37.025
Mind how that looks.

267
19:40.505 --> 19:41.905
It's about time.

268
19:41.985 --> 19:43.225
We should go get samples.

269
19:43.305 --> 19:45.705
I'll get the tools.

270
20:01.105 --> 20:02.305
All done.

271
20:02.385 --> 20:04.425
I'll go wash my hands. Let's meet over there.

272
20:15.945 --> 20:18.425
What are you looking at? You're smiling so sweetly.

273
20:19.105 --> 20:20.585
Chatting with your girlfriend?

274
20:31.385 --> 20:32.625
Get up.

275
20:37.065 --> 20:37.905
Something's up.

276
20:37.985 --> 20:41.065
Today, you made me bike alone,

277
20:41.145 --> 20:42.665
and you've been hiding smiles.

278
20:43.665 --> 20:44.865
What's up with that?

279
20:47.065 --> 20:47.905
Isn't it obvious?

280
20:51.225 --> 20:52.185
Wait, seriously?

281
20:56.145 --> 20:58.025
Chen Yanzhou,

282
20:58.105 --> 20:59.265
you jerk.

283
21:01.145 --> 21:02.385
You're already dating.

284
21:02.465 --> 21:04.705
Why are you fooling around with Zheng Yu?

285
21:04.785 --> 21:06.825
What if your girlfriend finds out?

286
21:07.745 --> 21:08.905
You…

287
21:08.985 --> 21:11.185
At most, people will call you a player.

288
21:11.265 --> 21:13.705
But how will she survive on campus?

289
21:15.105 --> 21:16.345
-Bi Dezheng. -What?

290
21:16.425 --> 21:17.905
No wonder you can't graduate.

291
21:17.985 --> 21:20.465
Hey, why are you attacking me?

292
21:21.945 --> 21:23.345
I have to hurry back.

293
21:23.425 --> 21:25.225
Don't make Zheng Yu wait.

294
21:26.225 --> 21:29.425
Chen Yanzhou, you had better watch out. I'm watching you.

295
21:44.705 --> 21:45.985
Zheng Yu.

296
21:46.865 --> 21:48.545
Zheng Yu, I have to talk to you.

297
21:53.505 --> 21:56.145
Where did you find so many student ID cards?

298
21:57.065 --> 21:58.665
I didn't find them.

299
21:58.745 --> 21:59.985
I borrowed them.

300
22:00.585 --> 22:03.025
You know, our student ID photos are unedited.

301
22:03.105 --> 22:04.785
It's as legit as a real ID card.

302
22:06.945 --> 22:08.985
Okay, then. See the card, see the man.

303
22:09.065 --> 22:10.065
I'll introduce them.

304
22:10.145 --> 22:13.745
They're all young, eligible bachelors.

305
22:13.825 --> 22:15.705
Li Geng, physical education.

306
22:15.785 --> 22:17.625
A total hunk.

307
22:17.705 --> 22:19.345
A long-distance running champ.

308
22:19.425 --> 22:21.425
One punch could take down two of me.

309
22:21.505 --> 22:22.465
But don't worry.

310
22:22.545 --> 22:25.025
He's very well-mannered and not violent.

311
22:26.745 --> 22:27.785
Not to your liking?

312
22:28.425 --> 22:29.505
Next.

313
22:30.265 --> 22:32.505
Wei Haijie, fine arts.

314
22:32.585 --> 22:35.585
He may have long hair and an air of indifference,

315
22:35.665 --> 22:37.545
but his paintings sell for thousands.

316
22:37.625 --> 22:39.265
And he loves to help others.

317
22:39.985 --> 22:41.105
Not interested either?

318
22:41.945 --> 22:42.905
Wait.

319
22:42.985 --> 22:45.465
Why are you showing me these?

320
22:47.865 --> 22:49.105
I just want to show you

321
22:49.185 --> 22:51.865
that there are plenty of outstanding men in the world.

322
22:51.945 --> 22:55.065
You don't have to put all your eggs in one basket.

323
22:55.145 --> 22:57.065
What's your type? Tell me.

324
22:57.145 --> 22:58.825
I will introduce guys to you.

325
22:59.585 --> 23:02.585
Here. Deng Zhenfei, same year as me.

326
23:02.665 --> 23:04.145
He may have a fair complexion,

327
23:04.225 --> 23:06.785
but he's the president of our school's Hiking Club.

328
23:06.865 --> 23:08.345
He's in peak condition.

329
23:08.425 --> 23:09.585
Chen Yanzhou.

330
23:15.265 --> 23:16.585
Eating together again?

331
23:17.465 --> 23:18.745
Clearly.

332
23:20.865 --> 23:21.745
What's up?

333
23:22.825 --> 23:23.745
He…

334
23:36.345 --> 23:38.585
None of them can fight.

335
23:40.905 --> 23:42.145
Shengyang.

336
23:46.065 --> 23:47.625
You've been standing here.

337
23:47.705 --> 23:49.545
Why haven't you changed and gone in?

338
23:51.865 --> 23:54.505
I just came from the boss's office.

339
23:54.585 --> 23:57.385
He gave me a box of chocolates. I wanted to share them.

340
24:00.745 --> 24:01.745
Yeah right.

341
24:02.825 --> 24:03.985
I just saw you.

342
24:04.065 --> 24:06.265
You were about to stuff it into that locker.

343
24:07.825 --> 24:10.545
Relax. I won't tell anyone.

344
24:10.625 --> 24:13.505
But this is way too indirect.

345
24:14.385 --> 24:17.705
We're not little kids. Who would get it from some chocolates?

346
24:18.665 --> 24:22.945
Well, everyone in the lab is busy and has no time for dating.

347
24:23.025 --> 24:24.465
It's better to take it slow.

348
24:26.705 --> 24:29.865
Okay, take it slow.

349
24:37.785 --> 24:39.945
The one he likes is Zheng Yu?

350
24:40.625 --> 24:42.905
Right! I nearly forgot!

351
24:42.985 --> 24:45.825
He's the one who recommended her to the boss.

352
24:46.665 --> 24:48.185
Shengyang!

353
24:48.265 --> 24:51.945
Taking it slow actually isn't a good idea. What if you miss your chance?

354
24:53.345 --> 24:54.425
What do you mean?

355
24:55.025 --> 24:55.945
Confess.

356
24:56.025 --> 24:57.145
You must confess.

357
25:12.385 --> 25:13.505
Zheng Yu.

358
25:16.825 --> 25:18.305
Shengyang.

359
25:18.385 --> 25:19.545
You didn't pick up.

360
25:19.625 --> 25:21.825
I guessed you were in class here.

361
25:22.905 --> 25:25.745
Did you come find me about something?

362
25:37.985 --> 25:39.625
Zheng Yu,

363
25:39.705 --> 25:42.025
we've known each other for three years, right?

364
25:43.265 --> 25:44.465
More or less.

365
25:45.985 --> 25:48.665
I remember I was an undergraduate senior,

366
25:48.745 --> 25:50.385
and you were a freshman.

367
25:50.465 --> 25:52.065
You were always on the go,

368
25:52.145 --> 25:53.905
picking up part-time gigs.

369
25:53.985 --> 25:57.265
I was reminded of when I first got into university.

370
25:57.345 --> 25:58.345
We're quite similar.

371
26:01.545 --> 26:03.745
My family is just getting by.

372
26:04.985 --> 26:06.865
I grew up with hardships.

373
26:06.945 --> 26:09.505
So I worked hard to get into this place

374
26:09.585 --> 26:11.385
to escape my old life.

375
26:12.745 --> 26:13.585
I get it.

376
26:17.145 --> 26:20.665
So before I achieved this goal,

377
26:21.625 --> 26:24.825
I didn't want to confess my feelings to the one I like.

378
26:26.865 --> 26:28.265
The only thing I could do

379
26:28.345 --> 26:31.265
was keep finding part-time gigs

380
26:31.345 --> 26:32.185
for her.

381
26:36.625 --> 26:37.905
Zheng Yu,

382
26:39.265 --> 26:40.105
I like you.

383
26:43.145 --> 26:45.145
-Shengyang, I-- -Let me finish.

384
26:46.185 --> 26:49.425
I planned to wait until I graduated with a master's degree.

385
26:50.105 --> 26:52.345
You'll be graduating with a bachelor's too.

386
26:52.425 --> 26:55.305
If you want to stay in Qingyi, I will stay with you.

387
26:56.305 --> 26:59.425
If you want to pursue a master's degree, I'll find a job.

388
27:01.305 --> 27:03.345
The best outcome is both of us staying.

389
27:03.425 --> 27:06.585
After all, the pay is good, and it's stable.

390
27:06.665 --> 27:08.985
Of course, this depends on your opinion.

391
27:09.065 --> 27:10.665
Shengyang,

392
27:10.745 --> 27:12.865
thank you for liking me.

393
27:12.945 --> 27:14.665
But

394
27:14.745 --> 27:16.305
there's someone I like already.

395
27:24.745 --> 27:25.865
Is it Chen Yanzhou?

396
27:28.745 --> 27:29.785
How did you know?

397
27:33.785 --> 27:37.185
At the boss's birthday party, I sensed something between you two.

398
27:40.305 --> 27:43.665
A while ago, you asked me to find out about the Haeckel Institute.

399
27:43.745 --> 27:46.625
You said it was for a very important friend.

400
27:47.225 --> 27:48.905
Is Chen Yanzhou that friend?

401
27:56.865 --> 28:00.425
Shengyang, I have to leave for my tutoring job.

402
28:03.385 --> 28:05.225
You can't go abroad with him.

403
28:05.825 --> 28:07.385
Would he stay for you?

404
28:08.185 --> 28:10.825
Or do you plan to have him pay

405
28:10.905 --> 28:12.185
for you to go with him?

406
28:17.185 --> 28:18.665
You've got it all wrong.

407
28:19.265 --> 28:20.785
I don't need him to stay.

408
28:20.865 --> 28:22.905
Nor do I need him to take me with him.

409
28:23.665 --> 28:26.865
I know what it feels like to carry too many burdens.

410
28:30.225 --> 28:31.945
So I hope that,

411
28:32.945 --> 28:34.625
at least from now on,

412
28:35.425 --> 28:36.825
he can be free.

413
29:01.625 --> 29:03.105
Chatting with Zheng Yu again?

414
29:04.145 --> 29:06.505
Yes. Who else would I be chatting with?

415
29:09.585 --> 29:10.545
My girlfriend?

416
29:13.425 --> 29:14.745
Chen Yanzhou,

417
29:15.425 --> 29:17.585
you're so shameless.

418
29:18.865 --> 29:21.265
You're even proud of cheating?

419
29:23.145 --> 29:24.705
You're even laughing?

420
29:28.865 --> 29:30.545
With your vivid imagination,

421
29:30.625 --> 29:32.065
didn't you ever consider

422
29:32.145 --> 29:35.145
that the two people in your story are the same person?

423
29:35.225 --> 29:36.865
What do you mean, two people…

424
29:37.945 --> 29:39.625
are… are the same person?

425
29:40.265 --> 29:41.465
W… What do you mean?

426
29:41.545 --> 29:43.025
Are you saying…?

427
29:44.225 --> 29:45.905
There has only ever been

428
29:46.505 --> 29:47.585
one person I like.

429
29:54.065 --> 29:55.465
Bro.

430
29:55.545 --> 29:57.025
Dear bro.

431
29:57.105 --> 29:58.665
I've done you wrong.

432
29:59.265 --> 30:00.665
I think I did

433
30:01.265 --> 30:02.505
something terrible.

434
30:07.185 --> 30:09.985
I didn't mean to push Shengyang to confess his feelings.

435
30:10.065 --> 30:11.825
I was out of ideas.

436
30:11.905 --> 30:14.545
If it could break you two up, I had to try it.

437
30:14.625 --> 30:17.545
I thought maybe Zheng Yu would be distracted after the confession.

438
30:17.625 --> 30:21.105
It sounded better than letting her end up as a side piece.

439
30:23.025 --> 30:26.105
I forgot. She's probably tutoring right now.

440
30:38.625 --> 30:39.945
Chen Yanzhou?

441
30:44.145 --> 30:45.305
Are you done tutoring?

442
30:46.905 --> 30:48.265
Why didn't you go in?

443
30:50.025 --> 30:51.345
I…

444
30:51.945 --> 30:54.625
Were you waiting for me?

445
30:56.345 --> 30:57.425
I…

446
30:58.305 --> 31:00.185
I just happened

447
31:00.265 --> 31:01.825
to be walking nearby.

448
31:05.185 --> 31:06.905
-Here? -Yes.

449
31:06.985 --> 31:07.825
Walking.

450
31:18.025 --> 31:19.025
So,

451
31:20.025 --> 31:21.065
today,

452
31:21.745 --> 31:23.345
did Shengyang confess to you?

453
31:28.505 --> 31:30.225
So

454
31:31.545 --> 31:32.785
what was your reply?

455
31:35.025 --> 31:36.145
I didn't accept.

456
31:40.585 --> 31:43.625
Were you waiting here for me

457
31:43.705 --> 31:44.665
to ask about this?

458
31:46.225 --> 31:47.665
I really was walking nearby.

459
31:51.345 --> 31:53.225
It's dark. I'll walk you back.

460
31:53.305 --> 31:54.145
It's on the way.

461
31:55.105 --> 31:57.065
A few kilometers' detour is on the way?

462
31:59.305 --> 32:01.705
All right. On the way.

463
32:02.425 --> 32:03.585
Let's go.

464
32:27.825 --> 32:29.025
By the way,

465
32:30.025 --> 32:31.705
stay away from Bi Dezheng.

466
32:33.185 --> 32:34.585
What did he do now?

467
32:35.785 --> 32:37.985
He actually suspected us of…

468
32:39.585 --> 32:42.505
Forget it. It's my fault.

469
32:43.105 --> 32:45.145
I'm usually too reserved.

470
32:45.225 --> 32:46.305
Some relationships

471
32:47.585 --> 32:49.225
should've been made official.

472
32:49.825 --> 32:51.425
W… What was that?

473
32:53.865 --> 32:55.665
-I mean… -I thought it was delicious.

474
32:55.745 --> 32:56.865
Me too.

475
33:02.105 --> 33:03.705
What's wrong?

476
33:03.785 --> 33:04.985
My roommates are back.

477
33:06.825 --> 33:08.585
It's Zheng Yu.

478
33:09.905 --> 33:11.225
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

479
33:12.065 --> 33:12.985
Zheng Yu,

480
33:13.065 --> 33:15.305
why are you lingering out here?

481
33:16.905 --> 33:19.785
We… We're discussing experiments.

482
33:21.025 --> 33:22.745
Did you just come from the lab?

483
33:22.825 --> 33:24.065
-Yes. -No.

484
33:28.065 --> 33:28.905
-Yes. -No.

485
33:35.025 --> 33:36.825
I'm not the dean,

486
33:36.905 --> 33:38.465
catching students dating.

487
33:39.905 --> 33:41.105
Why are you acting guilty?

488
33:41.945 --> 33:42.785
True.

489
33:44.265 --> 33:45.465
No reason to act guilty.

490
33:49.945 --> 33:51.785
No, it's not what you think.

491
33:52.385 --> 33:53.505
We…

492
33:54.705 --> 33:56.425
You should go home first.

493
33:57.305 --> 33:58.625
Then I'll go.

494
34:00.545 --> 34:01.945
Good night.

495
34:14.545 --> 34:17.065
Why are you looking at me?

496
34:18.225 --> 34:21.705
I've never seen an iron tree bloom, so I'm looking my fill.

497
34:23.185 --> 34:25.505
I'm getting goosebumps.

498
34:27.465 --> 34:28.625
You've misunderstood.

499
34:28.705 --> 34:30.905
Yes, we misunderstood.

500
34:30.985 --> 34:33.225
You were discussing experiments.

501
34:35.264 --> 34:40.625
Love is such a grand experiment.

502
34:42.985 --> 34:43.945
No.

503
34:44.025 --> 34:45.065
Yes.

504
34:45.145 --> 34:46.025
No.

505
34:46.105 --> 34:47.264
Yes.

506
34:47.344 --> 34:48.665
Good night.

507
34:48.744 --> 34:49.905
Right?

508
34:49.985 --> 34:51.744
Good night.

509
35:09.465 --> 35:10.625
What's wrong?

510
35:10.705 --> 35:11.785
My roommates are back.

511
35:35.825 --> 35:38.225
ZHENG YU

512
35:48.865 --> 35:50.705
If I fail my finals,

513
35:50.785 --> 35:52.545
Zheng Yu, you're responsible.

514
35:56.465 --> 35:57.665
Why am I responsible?

515
35:59.225 --> 36:01.065
Finals week just started.

516
36:01.825 --> 36:03.745
It's the time for rote memorization,

517
36:04.745 --> 36:07.825
but my mind is blank, with only two words echoing around.

518
36:10.705 --> 36:11.585
"Good night."

519
36:15.105 --> 36:17.345
Don't use the two of us as an excuse.

520
36:20.705 --> 36:23.225
-"Us." -"Us."

521
36:29.585 --> 36:30.585
CHEN YANZHOU

522
36:30.665 --> 36:32.545
When is your last final?

523
36:35.985 --> 36:37.585
Friday morning.

524
36:38.505 --> 36:40.705
Are you free after that?

525
36:41.985 --> 36:42.905
Yes.

526
36:42.985 --> 36:45.665
Say, will the first one of us to couple up

527
36:45.745 --> 36:46.905
be Zheng Yu?

528
36:48.425 --> 36:49.585
Anyway, it won't be me.

529
36:49.665 --> 36:51.425
Or me.

530
36:56.185 --> 36:57.625
CHEN YANZHOU

531
36:57.705 --> 37:01.505
Then let's go somewhere together on Friday.

532
37:01.585 --> 37:02.465
Okay.

533
37:02.545 --> 37:04.585
Going on a date right after exams?

534
37:07.665 --> 37:10.105
Xu Fangli, shouldn't you be studying?

535
37:10.185 --> 37:11.305
Study…

536
37:20.665 --> 37:25.345
Well, don't waste those clothes you bought when we went shopping.

537
37:34.145 --> 37:35.865
So how did exams go?

538
37:36.545 --> 37:38.585
Not bad. You?

539
37:39.145 --> 37:39.985
I don't know.

540
37:40.585 --> 37:41.825
You don't know?

541
37:42.625 --> 37:44.825
I guess I don't care as much anymore.

542
37:46.945 --> 37:48.585
Unbelievable.

543
37:49.345 --> 37:50.585
What?

544
37:50.665 --> 37:54.065
Someone is finally about to lose to me

545
37:54.145 --> 37:56.025
but tells me he doesn't care.

546
37:56.105 --> 37:57.585
Must be some mind game.

547
37:58.265 --> 37:59.545
Are you that confident?

548
38:00.465 --> 38:01.945
I'm definitely winning.

549
38:03.945 --> 38:05.465
What are you laughing for?

550
38:06.185 --> 38:07.385
I'm happy for you.

551
38:08.265 --> 38:09.945
I'm happy for you too.

552
38:10.025 --> 38:12.785
But where are we going?

553
38:12.865 --> 38:15.745
We've walked for so long. It's almost dark.

554
38:15.825 --> 38:17.185
We're almost there.

555
38:19.585 --> 38:21.585
-Quickly. -Hurry up.

556
38:22.385 --> 38:24.185
-Walk faster. -Hurry up.

557
38:26.985 --> 38:28.305
We're here.

558
38:29.905 --> 38:31.425
I remember you said

559
38:31.505 --> 38:33.585
you loved watching fish lantern parades.

560
38:33.665 --> 38:35.385
So I brought you here.

561
38:42.385 --> 38:43.585
It was the right choice.

562
38:44.185 --> 38:46.905
That's the lantern. It's the same as when I was a kid.

563
38:49.945 --> 38:52.905
Back then, my parents would take my brother and me

564
38:52.985 --> 38:54.625
and run after that lantern.

565
38:54.705 --> 38:57.185
I didn't know anything. I was just happy to run.

566
38:58.065 --> 38:59.265
Someone led the way.

567
38:59.345 --> 39:00.865
I just had to follow.

568
39:04.505 --> 39:05.425
You can still run.

569
40:24.665 --> 40:25.505
Zheng Yu.

570
40:29.345 --> 40:30.625
I like you.

571
40:43.385 --> 40:45.305
For a long time,

572
40:45.385 --> 40:46.825
my life was very simple.

573
40:47.665 --> 40:50.865
The lab, data figures, and my thesis.

574
40:51.945 --> 40:54.425
I thought that was my everything.

575
40:54.505 --> 40:56.385
Then

576
40:56.465 --> 40:57.345
you appeared.

577
40:58.705 --> 41:00.065
I started to notice you.

578
41:00.785 --> 41:02.985
I noticed the way you look when thinking.

579
41:03.705 --> 41:04.585
The way you frown.

580
41:06.105 --> 41:09.905
And when your eyes are red, but you still push on.

581
41:10.865 --> 41:13.305
And your smile.

582
41:33.185 --> 41:34.105
It's rare,

583
41:35.265 --> 41:36.745
but every time I see it,

584
41:36.825 --> 41:38.745
I think

585
41:38.825 --> 41:41.345
that my day isn't so bad after all.

586
41:45.545 --> 41:46.665
Zheng Yu,

587
41:47.665 --> 41:48.905
I like you.

588
41:49.625 --> 41:50.865
It's not maybe

589
41:50.945 --> 41:52.385
or possibly.

590
41:52.985 --> 41:55.825
It's a definite, unremitting,

591
41:55.905 --> 41:57.465
impossible-to-ignore feeling.

592
42:02.425 --> 42:04.025
I don't need an answer from you.

593
42:04.625 --> 42:06.465
You don't need to reply either.

594
42:07.465 --> 42:08.865
To me,

595
42:09.865 --> 42:11.745
compared to asking you to accept me,

596
42:12.665 --> 42:14.105
letting you know

597
42:14.905 --> 42:16.985
that someone likes you

598
42:18.185 --> 42:19.305
is more important.
